# Basic Flowchart and Pseudocode Problems

Create flowchart and pseudocode for the following problems.

---

## 1. Input a year and find whether it is a leap year or not
### Pseudocode
START  
Input year  
IF year % 400 == 0  
    Print "Leap Year"  
ELSE IF year % 100 == 0  
    Print "Not a Leap Year"  
ELSE IF year % 4 == 0  
    Print "Leap Year"  
ELSE  
    Print "Not a Leap Year" 
END

### Flowchart (Text)
Start → Input year →  
year % 400 == 0? → Leap Year → End  
Else → year % 100 == 0? → Not Leap Year → End  
Else → year % 4 == 0? → Leap Year → End  
Else → Not Leap Year → End

